---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Aakkam Corporate Solutions — Leadership & Capital Advisory"
  description="Discover Aakkam Corporate Solutions: our mission, institutional banking network, corporate capitalization strategies, and seasoned financial advisory team."
>

  <!-- Hero Header -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-blue-950 text-white py-10 sm:py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block bg-red-600 text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3">
        Corporate Profile
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
        About Aakkam Corporate Solutions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Building high-trust, time-bound financial roadmaps for high-growth enterprises and distressed turnarounds.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <main class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-5 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
          About Our Firm & Philosophy
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          <strong>Aakkam Corporate Solutions</strong> is a financial consulting and advisory firm started with the vision to make one of the most efficient financial and advisory services hubs with qualitative human interfacing technology.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          The mission of the company is maximizing client satisfaction through innovative, transparent, and need-based solutions. Aakkam is dedicated to providing top-notch financial solutions packages to its clients to help them achieve and sustain competitive advantage in the industry.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Strategic Capitalization in High-Growth Markets</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          We provide end-to-end advisory solutions to companies in high-growth markets for their capitalization and recapitalization strategy. Our mission is to help our clients secure the desired funding in the most efficient and time-bound manner. We not only provide advisory services to our clients but also make sure that the funding we arrange for our clients fits seamlessly into their long-term growth strategy. We provide our clients with a host of debt and equity solutions to meet their funding requirements.
        </p>

        <!-- Leadership Quote Box -->
        <blockquote class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-6 rounded-r-xl my-6">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 italic leading-relaxed">
            “During the course of our work, we have developed a very close interpersonal relationship with various Bankers & Private Equity firms which has helped us ensure that the client’s mandate gets executed in the most desirable manner within a legitimate time span.”
          </p>
          <footer class="mt-2 text-xs font-bold text-red-600 uppercase tracking-wide">
            — Aakkam Corporate Leadership
          </footer>
        </blockquote>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-4">Our Multidisciplinary Team</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          Our team of experienced professionals is dedicated to providing outstanding service, quantifiable value, and creative solutions that maximize gain for our clients. Our ethos and business approach are based upon complete trust, transparency, and high quality execution across all practice areas.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-6">
          <a
            href="/services"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 shadow-sm transition-all"
          >
            Explore All Practice Disciplines →
          </a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Sidebar currentPath="/about" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
